## Context

### Tasks completed this run
- **#1474 (Phase 1b: Lymphocytic enrichment method validation)**: Done. Competitive gene-set enrichment using MAGMA regression + Wilcoxon rank-sum on 2019 TS GWAS (N=14,307). 14 gene sets tested (9 DICE cell types + 3 MSigDB-derived + 2 aggregated). DICE_CD4_T borderline significant in Wilcoxon (z=1.65, p=0.0498, FDR=0.697). No FDR-significant sets. Script: src/tourettes/ts_neuroimmune_subtyping/02_lymphocytic_enrichment.py. Commit 009862e.

